{"text": "客厅里弥漫着火锅沸腾的氤氲热气，却暖不透角落里凝滞的空气。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_01.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0000.wav"}
{"text": "李萌猛地放下筷子，陶瓷撞在玻璃桌面上发出刺耳的声响。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_01.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0001.wav"}
{"text": "我吃饱了。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/emo_hate.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0002.wav"}
{"text": "萌萌，再吃点吧，你最喜欢的虾滑刚煮好。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/emo_hate.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0003.wav"}
{"text": "是啊，有什么事说出来大家一起解决。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_05.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0004.wav"}
{"text": "他偷偷瞥了一眼坐在对面的陈浩——后者正低头盯着碗里的蘸料，嘴角紧绷，手中的筷子无意识地搅动着。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_03.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0005.wav"}
{"text": "你们别管她，她就这脾气，一点小事就甩脸。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/emo_hate.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0006.wav"}
{"text": "是，我脾气差！那你呢？答应的事哪件做到了？", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_05.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0007.wav"}
{"text": "我那不是临时加班吗？", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_05.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0008.wav"}
{"text": "每次都是加班！上周末我生日你也加班？", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_05.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0009.wav"}
{"text": "都少说两句……", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_05.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0010.wav"}
{"text": "就在这剑拔弩张的时刻，门铃突然响了。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_01.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0011.wav"}
{"text": "所有人都愣住了。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_01.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0012.wav"}
{"text": "请问李萌女士在吗？有她的生日蛋糕，送件人陈先生——备注说补上周末的生日惊喜。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/emo_hate.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0013.wav"}
{"text": "客厅里霎时安静，只听见火锅咕嘟咕嘟的翻滚声。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_01.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0014.wav"}
{"text": "本来想等吃完饭再拿出来的……", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_05.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0015.wav"}
{"text": "李萌脸上的怒意如冰雪消融，转而是一种哭笑不得的动容。", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_01.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0016.wav"}
{"text": "你们俩啊……", "prompt_audio": "prompts/voice_05.wav", "emo_mode": "speaker", "out": "outputs\\segments\\seg_0017.wav"}
